flowchart LR
  staff[Academy staff browser] --> next[Next.js staff + student BFF]
  student[Student phone browser] --> next
  next -->|server-only bearer JWT| api[Spring Boot modular monolith API]
  api --> pg[(PostgreSQL: data, audit log, database queue)]
  zoom[Zoom Webinars] -->|signed HTTPS webhooks| api
  api -->|S2S OAuth: webinars, registrants, past runs, reports| zoom
  api -->|SMTP: invitations, resets, notices| mail[Mail provider]
  subgraph workers[Background workers in the API process]
    receipts[Zoom receipts] --> pg
    reports[Zoom reports] --> pg
    emails[Invitation emails] --> mail
    retention[Nightly retention] --> pg
  end
